<title>SAN MARINO: SOCCER-BELGIUM BEAT SAN MARINO 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELGIUM BEAT SAN MARINO 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SERRAVALLE, San Marino 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium beat San</p>
<p>Marino 3-0 (halftime 2-0) in a European Group Seven World Cup</p>
<p>qualifying match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Gert Verheyen (10th), Luc NIlis (20th, 46th)</p>
<p>Attendance - 1,353</p>
<p>Group seven standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Wales		  3   2   0   1  12   3    6</p>
<p> Belgium		2   2   0   0   5   1    6</p>
<p> Netherlands	  1   1   0   0   3   1    3</p>
<p> Turkey		 1   0   0   1   1   2    0</p>
<p> San Marino	   3   0   0   3   0  14    0</p>
<p>Next matches: Nov 9 Netherlands v Wales, Nov 10 Turkey v San</p>
<p>Marino.</p>
</text>
